{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0552_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0552_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5f92d592c0b126d2973bd0633be93b6e853e17f1aa4db91cf3bd168f0c313617", "ja": "あの日のわたし、今見ても絶好調ですね～。\n未来や環とのチームワークもバッチリ♪", "zh": "那天的我，现在看起来状态也超好呢～。\n和未来、环的团队配合也完美无缺♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0552_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0552_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7bd16899ad6f70385c69393d7123903a4e1cfa66a548c6be0c709ba6b57e2a35", "ja": "そうだな、敵なしって感じの圧巻プレーだよ。\n翼はバスケでもナンバーワンを目指せそうだな。", "zh": "确实，那场比赛的表现真是所向披靡，令人叹为观止。\n翼在篮球方面似乎也能以第一名为目标呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0552_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0552_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "88d5b56ab41b9f9144007082519060956880a45ca995da4f6b5e0782ecc5f9ed", "ja": "うーん……それはちょっと難しいかも。\nわたし、ぜったい勝てない強～い敵がいるんです！", "zh": "嗯……那个可能有点难。\n我有一个无论如何都赢不了的超～强对手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0552_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0552_1004_p", "source_sha256": "775762793ebd7322914d30ec427abbf2090310b888f0e75c971ceb209e9b03fb", "ja": "そうなのか？　翼でも勝てないとなると……\n学校のバスケ部の人とかか？", "zh": "是这样吗？要是连翼都赢不了的话……\n难道是学校篮球部的人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0552_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0552_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "504776aabce30139b776963459023c4e47ae529590177325de7188f2e48abcac", "ja": "残念、違いま～す！　正解は～……\n{$P$}さんで～す！", "zh": "很遗憾，不对～！正确答案是～……\n{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0552_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0552_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7d3aaf880135e753a2c0bca9c932ef2d14204d32647dc258d4c4fa9935af9acf", "ja": "え、俺？", "zh": "诶，我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0552_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0552_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c4ebca0fb8ea6754a69a932ec566c866e1a5b8ed5e3eb0cfe7901591c77dc7e0", "ja": "はい♪　大好きな{$P$}さんが\n相手チームにいたら、試合に集中できないですもん。", "zh": "是的♪　最喜欢的{$P$}先生要是在对手队伍里的话，就没办法集中精神比赛了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0552_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0552_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "736b3d617f69f26e408faf2605e527e5d08be9b8bf59e0eb6a3ba8cdefd42b23", "ja": "わざと負ける……なんてことはしませんけど、\nきっとミスは増えちゃうだろうなぁ。", "zh": "故意输掉……这种事虽然我不会做，\n但失误肯定会变多吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0552_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0552_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "003901ac4795fd8dfbd0ab2cbc53580e11f08d3c6f857c9967b144df45971ad7", "ja": "だから、わたしにとって一番の強敵は、\n{$P$}さんです、えへへ♪", "zh": "所以，对我来说最强的对手就是{$P$}先生，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
